                <pb facs="0175" n="155" sameAs="frus:frus1961-63v02/pg155"/>

                <head>71. Editorial Note</head>
                <p>On February 19, 1962, Secretary of Defense McNamara, Admiral Felt, Ambassador
                    Nolting, General Harkins, Assistant Secretary of State Harriman, and numerous
                    other officials met at CINCPAC Headquarters in Honolulu for the third Secretary
                    of Defenseʼs Conference. A full record of the meeting is in Washington National
                    Records Center, RG 84, Saigon Embassy Files: FRC 68 5159, SGN (62) 19
                    GVN-DEFSEC-CINCPAC. For a summary record, see <ref target="#d77">Document
                        77</ref>. Regarding the second Honolulu Conference, January 15, see <ref
                        target="#d22">Document 22</ref>.</p>
            </div>
